 # Settlement reports
 
 Streaming services send a settlement per period instead of orders.
+
+## Bokbasen subscriptions
+
+In Bokbasen Meta, open Rapporter → Abonnementstjenester and export "Lyttinger per ISBN"
+for the quarter. Upload it under Import → Orders → Settlement report and pick
+"Bokbasen – abonnementstjenester". Check the preview before importing.
